<title>UK: Jardine Strategic results flat amid buyback.</title>
<headline>Jardine Strategic results flat amid buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million $ unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (cents,basic)	37.92		  vs 38.02</p>
<p> Net asset value,$/shr  5.75		   vs 4.89</p>
<p> Dividend (cents)	 9.9		    vs 9.9</p>
<p> Total dividend (cents) 14.5		   vs 14.5</p>
<p> Net			  301.9		  vs 291.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   7,204		  vs 6,437</p>
<p>Full company name of Hong Kong-based holding company is Jardine Strategic Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it would offer shareholders a bonus issue of put warrants on a one-for-20 basis, excerciseable at $3.80 each on July 7, 1997.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44-171 542 7717</p>
